5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Hey everyone. I’m worried we’re picking a bin plan that makes us hate each other. Can we focus on keeping the lane friendly?,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh, Kenji, you’re right. We must keep our lane pleasant. I worry about the daily smell, too. Let’s find a gentle solution.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I need to quantify the time cost. We cannot agree to a burden we haven’t measured. What are the specific hours involved?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to check if one house is stuck with the bin forever. That feels unfair! We need to look at the frontages to see who gets what.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, fairness is vital. But before we divide the burden, we must understand the total cost. Let us look at the ledger and the subsidy.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, I agree on the money. But @Rin, checking the frontages helps us see who’s actually affected. Let’s look at those measurements too.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Rin, you are so thoughtful. I would love to see the measurements too, to understand our little corner better.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, the ledger shows past costs, not future labor. I need the truck arrival time to calculate the actual waiting hours.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, the truck time is good, but I really need the frontage measurements to prove who is stuck with the bin!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, your precision is wise. I will check the ward subsidy and the block ledger to see what we truly owe.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Asuka, I’ll check the truck time too. Knowing when it arrives helps us plan our mornings without stress.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, that sounds lovely. I will look into the ward complaint log to see what has troubled us before, and the station block’s minutes for ideas.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, the truck time is essential for my calculation. I will also review the ward filing requirements to ensure our arrangement is legally sound and sustainable.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Kenji, I’m checking the frontage measurements and the station block’s bin house! I want to see how they handle it so we don’t get stuck!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Shizue, your historical perspective is wise. I will review the ward complaint log and the block ledger to understand our true financial and social standing.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Shizue, I’ll check the residents’ meeting statements and the supervised mornings. I want to see how we can talk to each other again.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"Thank you, Kenji. I will look into the ward complaint log and the station block’s meeting minutes to understand our history.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will review the ward filing requirements and the truck arrival time. These define the legal and temporal constraints of our labor.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
